        "subheading_Ap9e3B": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "<p>When I founded YARA SHOEMAKER, I wasn’t simply creating a fashion house. I wanted to create a Maison where every decision would begin with respect — respect for the woman who entrusts us with one of life’s most meaningful occasions, respect for the artisans whose dedication preserves the extraordinary heritage of Haute Couture, and respect for the unseen details that deserve the same care as those the world will admire.<br/><br/>To me, true luxury has never been measured by excess. It is measured by intention, integrity, and the responsibility of creating something worthy of becoming part of another person’s life. That promise continues to guide every creation we make today.</p>",
            "text_max_width": 41
          }
